<title>HONG KONG: Perfect Treasure declares 1st H1 results.</title>
<headline>Perfect Treasure declares 1st H1 results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   9.13</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  4.34 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    36.54</p>
<p>    Turnover		     696.91</p>
<p>    Company name		 Perfect Treasure (Holding) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Photographic and consumer electrical products distributor Perfect Treasure was listed on the Stock Exchange on July 10, 1996.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain from interest on subscription money received for the listing.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
